  "historyNote": "#8738, eff 10-18-06; amd by #10239, eff 3-18-13; ss by #10817, eff 5-17-15 (from Per 602.02); ss by #14433 (formerly Per 602.03), eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES 12-1-35",
